  "articleBodyHtml": "<h2>Introduction and Login Bonus Discussion</h2>\n<p>The transcript begins with a discussion about a login bonus campaign, where the speaker mentions a special login bonus with a reward of up to 20 Saint Quartz. The speaker also notes that the login bonus is available until August 28th, emphasizing the importance of not missing the deadline. This is contrasted with another bonus period that ends on October 31st.</p>\n<p>The speaker also mentions the possibility of returning to the game to receive rewards, expressing a sense of missing someone or something, which may be related to a character or a previous experience.</p>\n<h2>Character and Design Discussion</h2>\n<p>There is a mention of a character named John Alter, who is referred to as &#x27;the evil one.&#x27; The speaker recalls that this character was previously part of the game and had an edgy design. Additionally, the speaker notes that John Alter provided information about part one of the game, and his information was considered very good.</p>\n<p>The speaker also mentions losing a character named Jack and expressing a sense of missing Jack, along with having a favorite outfit for another character.</p>\n<h2>Discussion on FGO and Gaming Experience</h2>\n<p>The transcript includes a discussion about FGO (Fate/Grand Order), with the speaker and another person (Kurowich) talking about the game. The speaker mentions that FGO is easier and encourages others to play it. There is also a focus on the pronunciation of FGO, which is described as three syllables.</p>\n<p>The speaker also reflects on their experience with the game, noting that they are a gamer who can grind units regardless of their tier. They express frustration but also appreciation for the use of units in FGO.</p>\n<h2>Conclusion and Acknowledgment</h2>\n<p>The discussion concludes with the speaker expressing gratitude and acknowledging the guest, Kurowich, for joining the conversation. There is also a brief mention of the speaker&#x27;s previous experience with the CE (possibly a campaign or event) and the artist involved.</p>\n<h2>Additional Notes and Corrections</h2>\n<p>There are a few moments of correction and redirection in the transcript, such as when the speaker says, &#x27;Never mind. Oh, okay. FGO, never mind.&#x27; This suggests a minor confusion or correction in the discussion.</p>\n<p>The speaker also mentions that they previously had limited opportunities to talk about certain topics, such as the CE and the artist, but were able to discuss them in this session.</p>\n<h2>Summary of Key Points</h2>\n<p>The transcript covers a range of topics, including login bonuses, character discussions, FGO gameplay, and personal reflections on gaming experiences. Key points include the availability of a special login bonus, the mention of characters like John Alter and Jack, the discussion on FGO, and the acknowledgment of the guest, Kurowich.</p>\n<h2>記事情報</h2>\n<p>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5xNVHzLzi80</p>",
